 function with no parameters\r\n\r\n## PR Checklist\r\nPlease check if your PR fulfills the following requirements:\r\n\r\n- [X] The commit message follows our guidelines: https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/main/contributing-docs/commit-message-guidelines.md\r\n- [X] Tests for the changes have been added (for bug fixes / features)\r\n\r\n\r\n## PR Type\r\nWhat kind of change does this PR introduce?\r\n\r\n<!-- Please check the one that applies to this PR using \"x\". -->\r\n\r\n- [X] Bugfix\r\n\r\n\r\n## What is the current behavior?\r\n<!-- Please describe the current behavior that you are modifying, or link to a relevant issue. -->\r\n\r\nAfter migration, event emitters of type @Output that have a function with empty 'emit' (without any parameters) report an error because the 'emit' function expects a mandatory parameter.\r\n\r\nIssue Number: #58650 \r\n\r\n\r\n## What is the new behavior?\r\n\r\nInsert a TODO comment for empty emit (without parameter).\r\n\r\n## Does this PR introduce a breaking change?\r\n\r\n- [ ] Yes\r\n- [X] No\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/60763/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/60763/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":17156120832,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAXExC86ecUx6zwAAAAP-laEA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/17156120832","actor":{"login":"aparzi","id":16490359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDkwMzU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16490359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aparzi","html_url":"https://github.com/aparzi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aparzi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aparzi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aparzi/gists{/gist_id}